  m_text: "High above the valley stands Sparrow's Peak, the peaceful sanctuary of the forest birds.\n\nSuddenly, a strange corruption has swept across the mountain\u2014turning harmless roots into deadly thorns, filling the woods with unstable mushrooms, and driving the sky creatures mad."
