  m_text: "Visual Assets: \n - Willowwood - Free Low Poly Nature Pack by BluBlu Games\n - Sparrow - Quirky Series by Omabuarts Studio\n - Free Pack - Easter Egg by PolyOne Studio\nVFX:\n - Cartoon FX Remaster Free by Jean Moreno\nSFX:\n - Attack sound: Macaw Sound by DRAGON-STUDIO\n - Death sound: CrowOrRaven1 by iwanPlays (Freesound)\n - Ammo powerup: Water droplets by Oxidvideos\n - Healing powerup: Spell Casting by Universfield\n - Explosive mushroom : explosion by siz0frena\n - Explosive egg: rubble_explode by canberries4\n - Drop egg: Drop Sound by qubodup\n - Level completed: UI Toast Notification by Qvantor\nUI: \n - Farm Game UI - Starter 2D by maanetorn\n - Free Crack Egg Animation by IvI Quddusi"
